DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250831
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250901
SUMMARY:Google Play: New Android TV apps and updates must target API 34
DESCRIPTION:What happens: New Android TV apps and app updates must target A
 ndroid 14 (API level 34) or higher to be submitted to Google Play.\nWho: A
 ndroid TV apps submitted to Google Play whose manifest requires the Androi
 d TV feature\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/google-play/tv-target-api-2026/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Google Play: New Android TV apps and updates must target API 34
 : in 30 days
TRIGGER:-P30D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Google Play: New Android TV apps and updates must target API 34
 : in 7 days
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
