BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:google-play/flutter-target-api-2026-existing
DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260831
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:Google Play: Existing Flutter apps must target API 35 to stay avail
 able to new users
DESCRIPTION:What happens: Existing apps must target Android 15 (API level 3
 5) or higher to remain available to new users on devices running Android O
 S higher than your app's target API level.\nWho: Flutter phone and tablet 
 apps already published on Google Play whose Gradle script takes targetSdk 
 from flutter.targetSdkVersion\nExtension until 2026-11-01: On request in P
 lay Console\nLast verified 2026-11-24
URL:https://warnahead.pages.dev/deadlines/google-play/flutter-target-api-20
 26-existing/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
