DTSTAMP:20261124T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Google Play: App updates must support 16 KB memory pages
DESCRIPTION:What happens: App updates that target Android 15 (API level 35)
  or higher and do not support 16 KB memory page sizes on 64-bit devices ca
 n't be released on Google Play.\nWho: Android phone and tablet apps submit
 ted to Google Play that target API 35 or higher\nLast verified 2026-11-24
